ta","data":[{"unit":1,"title":3,"area":104,"prev":26,"next":106,"titles":108,"firmware":41},{"id":2,"title":3,"aliases":4,"area":10,"order":11,"path":12,"context":13,"summary":20,"status":21,"firmware":22,"facts":27,"procedures":63,"parameters":72,"related":73,"body":83,"sources":84,"official_url":31,"controls":94},"instrument.overview","Instrument mode",[5,6,7,8,9],"instrument tracks","sound tracks","tracks 1–8","instrument pages","instrument modules","instrument",0,"knowledge/manual/units/instrument/overview.md",{"modes":14,"screens":15},[10],[16,17,18,19],"M1","M2","M3","M4","Instrument mode holds the eight tracks that make sound. Each track runs one engine — a synth, a sampler or the midi engine — and is shaped on four pages: engine, envelopes, filter and LFO.","current",{"min":23,"changed_in":24,"guide_version":25,"verified_on":26},"1.0.9",[],"1.1.15",null,[28,33,37,43,46,50,54,58],{"id":29,"text":30,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"eight-tracks","Instrument mode holds eight instrument tracks, one per track key `T1`…`T8`; the eight auxiliary tracks have a mode of their own.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#project","official",{"id":34,"text":35,"source":36,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"pages","`M1` shows the engine, `M2` the amp and filter envelopes, `M3` the filter and `M4` the LFO.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument",{"id":38,"text":39,"source":40,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":41,"confidence":42},"choose-engine","On OS 1.1.33, `shift + M1` brings up the preset browser for the selected track, where loading one of an engine's presets changes the engine.","docs/research/59-screen-profiling.md#26-preset-browser-shift--m1","1.1.33","verified",{"id":44,"text":45,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"browse","`shift + Tn` opens the preset browser for that track, where a preset, sample pack or engine can be loaded in one go.",{"id":47,"text":48,"source":49,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"preset-settings","`shift + instrument` opens the preset settings: tuning, velocity sensitivity, width and modulation routing of the track's sound.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#preset-settings",{"id":51,"text":52,"source":53,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"sound-actions","With a track key held, the module keys act on that track's whole sound: `Tn + M1` scrambles it, `Tn + M2` copies it, `Tn + M3` pastes onto it and `Tn + M4` saves it as a preset.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/instrument#view-and-create-preset",{"id":55,"text":56,"source":57,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"defaults","A fresh project puts drums on tracks 1 and 2, a bass on 3, a pluck on 4, a lead on 5, a soft pluck on 6, strings on 7 and a pad on 8.","https://teenage.engineering/guides/op-xy/get-started#4.%20get%20started",{"id":59,"text":60,"source":61,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":62},"default-engines","Community captures name the engines behind those sounds as the drum sampler on tracks 1 and 2, then prism, epiano, dissolve, hardsync, axis and multisampler on tracks 3 to 8.","docs/research/20-midi-control.md#21-the-16-tracks-and-their-default-channels","community",[64],{"id":65,"goal":66,"preconditions":67,"steps":68,"result":26,"source":31,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":32},"enter","Open instrument mode and select a track",[],[69,70],{"keys":10,"note":26,"set":26},{"keys":71,"note":26,"set":26},"T1…T8",[],[74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82],"instrument.engine","instrument.envelopes","instrument.filter","instrument.lfo","instrument.preset-browser","instrument.preset-settings","instrument.save-copy-scramble","basics.modules","auxiliary.overview","Pick a track, then work through its pages: the engine creates the tone, the envelopes shape each\nnote, the filter colours it and the LFO adds movement; every value can be parameter-locked per step.\nA track's complete sound travels as one preset, so a load from the browser (`shift + Tn`, or\n`shift + M1` for the selected track) changes everything at once, the engine included. Brain, send\neffects, external gear and tape live in auxiliary mode.",[85,87,88,90,91,92,93],{"url":31,"kind":86},"guide",{"url":36,"kind":86},{"url":40,"kind":89},"research",{"url":49,"kind":86},{"url":53,"kind":86},{"url":57,"kind":86},{"url":61,"kind":89},[95,96,97,98,99,100,101,102,103],"key.instrument","track.1","track.2","track.3","track.4","track.5","track.6","track.7","track.8",{"id":10,"title":105},"Instrument",{"id":74,"title":107},"Engine page and changing engine (M1)",{"basics.key-notation":109,"basics.main-modes":110,"basics.modules":111,"basics.track-buttons":112,"basics.linked-tracks":113,"basics.patterns-scenes-songs":114,"basics.workflow":115,"basics.firmware-versions":116,"hardware.layout":117,"hardware.power-and-charging":118,"hardware.connectors":119,"hardware.specifications":120,"hardware.te-boot":121,"hardware.firmware-update":122,"hardware.factory-reset":123,"hardware.system-menu":124,"hardware.safety-and-care":125,"hardware.in-the-box":126,"sequencer.overview":127,"sequencer.step-entry":128,"sequencer.step-recording":129,"sequencer.live-recording":130,"sequencer.extend-notes":131,"sequencer.nudge":132,"sequencer.single-sound":133,"sequencer.rotate":134,"sequencer.copy-step":135,"sequencer.transpose-sequence":136,"sequencer.parameter-locks":137,"sequencer.clear-and-undo":138,"sequencer.step-components":139,"sequencer.step-component-reference":140,"sequencer.component-pulse":141,"sequencer.component-pulse-hold":142,"sequencer.component-multiply":143,"sequencer.component-velocity":144,"sequencer.component-ramp-up":145,"sequencer.component-ramp-down":146,"sequencer.component-random":147,"sequencer.component-portamento":148,"sequencer.component-bend":149,"sequencer.component-tonality":150,"sequencer.component-jump":151,"sequencer.component-skip-parameter-loc